<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-027" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-027-wangjiong-anmin" source-id="s-nanqishu-027-wangjiong-anmin-ws1508012">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-027-wangjiong-anmin:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">城局參軍<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangjiong-anmin:p001:m0004" ref="0ra_fe7_j4d">王迥</persName>素為<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangjiong-anmin:p001:m0008" ref="4xf_x1f_vsg">安民</persName>所親，盜絹二匹，<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangjiong-anmin:p001:m0018" ref="4xf_x1f_vsg">安民</persName>流涕謂之曰：「我與卿契闊備嘗，今日犯王法，此乃卿負我也。」於軍門斬之，厚為斂祭，軍府皆震服。</p>
</text>
